          "note": "Even fully licensed TradFi operators like Robinhood cannot achieve compliant crypto offerings, while stablecoin payments touching bank or card rails immediately inherit full VASP compliance obligations—creating a structural barrier that slows convergence and creates legal exposure for hybrid products.",
