          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "DeFi protocols integrating TradFi benchmarks (SOFR onchain) and institutional custody standards introduce new attack surfaces at the TradFi-DeFi seam, where a contract failure carries reputational contagion into regulated finance for the first time.",
